<title>CANADA: Hudson's Bay Co Q4 Jan 31 net doubles.</title>
<headline>Hudson's Bay Co Q4 Jan 31 net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.36		   C$0.70</p>
<p> Net			 81,089		   41,017</p>
<p> Revs		   1,970,241		1,902,236</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.61		   C$0.59</p>
<p> Net			 36,141		   34,550</p>
<p> Revs		   6,007,212		5,984,518</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Quarter and year ended January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The retailer took a C$64 million restructuring loss in fiscal 1997 to merge its Zellers and Bay's head offices.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
